        "content": "**2027 stack demand** (source: clearing-2026.mehrs.net / uk-clearing-advisor-2027 SearchCourses logs, eu-west-1). Richer schema: qualification path, priority, location, geo. Low volume until the site takes real traffic.\n\n**Note:** synthetic monitoring-canary traffic (User-Agent `ClearingAdvisor2027-Canary/1.0`) is excluded from every demand panel above and shown only in the dedicated canary panel, so real student usage stats are not polluted."
